2 CONC a daughter of Ulvilde Jonsdotter (Grease), ridderen Mr. Jon Wax farsøster.13 Torleiv Benkestokks mother, Bergit, led weapon ox head in rosenkrans [ Mrs Kirstine Trond dotter Benkestokks anevåpen 1572]. The same weapon was led by r
