2 CONT Elisabeth Christophersdatter4 Darre (Christopher3Bjørnssøn, Bjørn2Rolfssøn, Rolf1Olufssøn); born circa 1605; married Olav Jonsson Bude, son of Jon Nilsson and Karen Olsdotter, 1635; died 7 Oct 1685.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elisabeth Christophersdatter4 Darre and Olav Jonsson Bude were as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT 23 i. Sara Olufsdatter5 Budde; born circa 1630; married Jacob Augustinusen Wivel, son of Augustinius Jensen and Marit (Wivel) Kristensdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 24 ii. Christopher Olufssøn Bude, born 1642; married Dorthe Melchiorsdatter Quentleur.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 25 iii. Jonas Olufssøn Bude, born 23 Jan 1644 at Snåsa; married Alhed Nielsdatter Wiborg.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 26 iv. Mentz Olufssøn Bude, born circa 1645.
2 CONT
2 CONT 27 v. Karen Olufsdatter Bude.
2 CONT
2 CONT 28 vi. Sophie Olufsdatter Budde.
2 CONT
