2 CONC ddition was 'protector' of the Crown properties at Voss.  Two of their daughters married farm boys from Voss and after them we have a wide-spread linage in the district.It was called the 'bailiff lineage'.
2 CONT 23 JAN 2014 20:54:45  15 JAN 2012 19:50:26 
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
