2 CONT (--?--) Torgersdtr Slettebø was born at Bjerkreim, Rogaland, Norway. She married Laurits Lauritsen Fuglestad, son of Lauritz Rasmussen Fuglestad and (--?--) Olsdtr Bjerkreim. She married Gjermund Tollefsen Årrestad, son of Tollef 
2 CONC Gjermundsen Øksnevad and (--?--) Hoversdtr Orrestad, before 1624. She died circa 1632 at Bjerkreim 7B, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, Norway. She is mentioned Bjerkreim i. 135, Lund 110.
2 CONT
2 CONT Laurits Lauritsen Fuglestad was born before 1563 at Fuglestad, Ogna, Rogaland, Norway. He married (--?--) Torgersdtr Slettebø, daughter of lensmann Torger Njeldsen Slettebø and Bodil (--?--). He died before 1624 at Bjerkreim 7A, B
2 CONC jerkreim, Rogaland, Norway. He is
2 CONT
2 CONT mentioned Lund 110.
