2 CONT
2 CONT Von Quitzow
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopediaJump to:navigation, search 
2 CONT
2 CONT The von Quitzow family is a noble family of Brandenburg, whose power in the late thirteenth and early fourteenth century was so great that this period of Brandenburg history is sometimes called the "Age of the von Quitzows." Its m
2 CONC ost famous sons were the robber barons, the brothers Dietrich (born 1366) and Hans (born 1370). Extinct[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT  This article on a member of the German nobility is a stub. You can help Wikipedia by expanding it. 
2 CONT
