1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *[https://forum.arkivverket.no/topic/235090-j%C3%B8rgen-pederson-staur-busett-p%C3%A5-sakshaug-inder%C3%B8y-avliden-1588-lagmann-i-trondheim-fr%C3%A5-1565-gift-med-gudrun-teiste-huslyden-deira/ Debatt i Brukerforum
