4 CONT I am currently working on my Swedish great grandfather's "Life and Times" from living in Sweden, embarking on his journey from Sweden, via England, France etc and arrival in New Zealand.   Johannes Matthiason (with variations but 
4 CONC anglicised to Mattson in New Zealand) was a Master Baker and it seems that he was a "Master Baker-Sailor" on ships.   Johannes left Tjorn when he was living in Svanvik, previously Balkerod where he was born.   I am learning so muc
4 CONC h about my Swedish roots and thanks to a Swedish resident, cousin Roland Palmqvist, a lot of doors have opened up that I have been able to "walk" through.
4 CONT
4 CONT I appreciate what you do to give us some meat on our genealogy bones, as it were.
3 NOTE His name is third from the top on the right page. 
3 NOTE Trond Olsson is my 11th Great Grandfather from Valla, Tjorn.   It was exciting to see this document.
