1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Jens Larsen (Lauritzen) Bugge (c. 1542 – 1612)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT Herr Jens Bugge was a prominent clergyman, serving as the parish priest of Ringsaker for 40 years. He was also the Dean (prost) of Hedmarken and Østerdalen, and a Canon in Hamar. He was born around 1542.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biographical Highlights:'''
2 CONT * '''1570''': Became chaplain in Ringsaker under Christen Hvid and married Hvid's daughter (his first wife, who died young).
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''1581/82''': Succeeded to the parish of Ringsaker.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''July 13, 1589''': Married '''Zephora Petersdatter''', who lived as a widow until at least 1638.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''1594''': Elected Dean.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on Easter Sunday, April 12, 1612, at the age of 70. His gravestone is located in Ringsaker Church, featuring his merchant's mark (bumerke).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''':
2 CONT # '''Lauritz (Lars)'''
2 CONT # '''Erik'''
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/Niels-Bugge/6000000014608872032?through=6000000002870921734 '''Niels''']
2 CONT # '''Karen'''
2 CONT # '''Henrich'''
2 CONT # '''Anne Christine'''
2 CONT # '''Peder'''
2 CONT # '''Mickell'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''':
2 CONT * Bugge, Kjeld. [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/2023/937697.pdf Ulrik - slekten Bugge.] Oslo, 1948. P. 7, 109.
