1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Niels Bugge (c. 1604 – ?)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels Bugge was the son of the prominent clergyman '''Jens Lauritzen Bugge of Ringsaker''' and his second wife, '''Zephora Petersdatter'''
2 CONT .
2 CONT '''Education:'''
2 CONT On July 20, 1627, he was enrolled as a student in Copenhagen under the names ''Nicolaus Iohannis Bugeus or Nicol Buggerus.''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Larvik Branch Connection:'''
2 CONT Niels is regarded as the presumptive father of '''Thomas Nielsen Bugge''', the ancestor of the Larvik branch. Several factors support this connection:
2 CONT * Thomas's father was named Niels.
2 CONT * Both Thomas and his brother '''Christen''' named their daughters '''Benedicte''', suggesting this was the name of Niels's wife.
2 CONT * Thomas's standing as a timber merchant and official aligns with Niels’s family background.
2 CONT * Thomas settled in Larvik, where one of his uncles (Niels’s brother) was already established as a major timber merchant - the same trade Thomas himself initially pursued.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''':
2 CONT # '''Thomas Nielsen Bugge''' (c. 1630 – 1691). Town bailiff (byfoged) and merchant in Larvik.
2 CONT # '''Christen Nielsen Bugge''' (d. 1680).
2 CONT # '''Mette Nilsdatter Bugge''' (d. 1719).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''':
2 CONT * Bugge, Kjeld. [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/2023/937697.pdf Ulrik - slekten Bugge]. Oslo, 1948. P. 9.
2 CONT
2 CONT “Niels Bugge, født ca. 1604, student 20. juli 1627 i Kbh. ([https://archive.org/details/kjbenhavnsuniv01kbuoft/page/86/mode/1up?q=Bugeus Nicolaus Iohannis Bugeus / Nicol Buggerus]). Det er alt som vites sikkert om ham, '''men det 
2 CONC er meget som tyder på at han var far av Larvik-slektens stamfar byfogd Thomas Bugge, slekt nr. 1'''. Hans far het nemlig Niels. Thomas var først trelasthandler i Larvik og nevnes som sådan alt i 1658. Tre av Niels’ brødre var borg
2 CONC ere (den ene stor [https://www.geni.com/people/Lauritz-Lars-Bugge/6000000218201483878?through=6000000014608872032 trelasthandler]) og to var prester, så det høver bra at Thomas var både borger og embetsmann. Den ene [https://www.g
2 CONC eni.com/people/Erik-Bugge/6000000003898356864?through=6000000014608872032 onkelen] bodde like ved Larvik hvor Thomas slo seg ned. Claus Bertelsen i Larvik (slekt nr. 10) synes ikke å ha hatt noe å gjøre med denne slekten. Thomas’ 
2 CONC mor het nok Benedicte fordi både Thomas og broren Christen brukte det navnet på sine døtre.” 
